---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Seed Our Becoming · Quest Labs"
  description="Sponsor a seat in FLIP. Fund an educator's place in the room. 20 sponsored seats available — pay it forward and materially disrupt systems of harm."
>

<main class="bet-page">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="bet-hero">
      <h1>Seed our becoming.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Wish you could do something to <span class="accent-phrase">materially shift the trajectory of a wayward world driven by nefarious nonsense?</span> You can. This is how.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-body">
        <span class="hero-brand">Quest Labs</span> is fueled by <strong class="faith-word">FAITH</strong> and by people who believe that real change starts in the body, the community, and the classroom long before it trickles into our media feed.
      </p>
      <div class="faith-reveal" aria-label="FAITH: Finding Alternative Innovative Transformative Heartspaces">
        <div class="faith-item" tabindex="0">
          <span class="faith-item-letter" aria-hidden="true">F</span>
          <div class="faith-item-text">
            <span class="faith-item-word">Finding</span>
            <span class="faith-item-gloss">the quest is to always question</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faith-item" tabindex="0">
          <span class="faith-item-letter" aria-hidden="true">A</span>
          <div class="faith-item-text">
            <span class="faith-item-word">Alternative</span>
            <span class="faith-item-gloss">post-now futures that haven't been given space to breathe yet</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faith-item" tabindex="0">
          <span class="faith-item-letter" aria-hidden="true">I</span>
          <div class="faith-item-text">
            <span class="faith-item-word">Innovative</span>
            <span class="faith-item-gloss">open innovation, co-created with community</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faith-item" tabindex="0">
          <span class="faith-item-letter" aria-hidden="true">T</span>
          <div class="faith-item-text">
            <span class="faith-item-word">Transformative</span>
            <span class="faith-item-gloss">personal and social transformation, both at once</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faith-item" tabindex="0">
          <span class="faith-item-letter" aria-hidden="true">H</span>
          <div class="faith-item-text">
            <span class="faith-item-word">Heartspaces</span>
            <span class="faith-item-gloss">lead with the heart, let the head follow</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="faith-hint">hover each letter · tap on mobile</p>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-body">
        You're planting seeds for a future we haven't fully seen or imagined yet. You might find yourself yearning for a world our future ancestors will be proud we chose.
      </p>
    </section>

    <hr class="section-rule" />

    <!-- Tiers -->
    <section class="tiers-section">
      <p class="section-label-large">Choose Your Contribution</p>

      <!-- Tier 5: The Wish -->
      <div class="tier-card">
        <div class="tier-header">
          <div class="tier-symbol">🎁</div>
          <div class="tier-title-block">
            <h2 class="tier-name">The Wish</h2>
            <p class="tier-tagline">As you wish.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-price">Any amount</div>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">
          You know what feels right. Every contribution goes directly into keeping this work alive, accessible, and audacious. No amount is too small to matter.
        </p>
        <div class="tier-actions">
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/7sY3cp7Y7h1VdIhb553wQ0a" class="pay-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Make a wish →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tier 1: The Spark -->
      <div class="tier-card">
        <div class="tier-header">
          <div class="tier-symbol">🔥</div>
          <div class="tier-title-block">
            <h2 class="tier-name">The Spark</h2>
            <p class="tier-tagline">Fund one sponsored participant's place.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-price">$500</div>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">
          Fund one participant's place in a 12-week Quest Labs crew. Name someone specific, or leave the seat open for whoever needs it most. A single spark is how every fire starts.
        </p>
        <div class="tier-actions">
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/00w3cp7Y76nh9s1b553wQ0b" class="pay-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Plant $500 →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tier 2: The Pair -->
      <div class="tier-card tier-featured">
        <div class="tier-header">
          <div class="tier-symbol">👥</div>
          <div class="tier-title-block">
            <h2 class="tier-name">The Pair</h2>
            <p class="tier-tagline">Two sponsored seats.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-price">$1,000</div>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">
          Two seats, fully flexible, same crew or different, your call or theirs. Send them to anyone, anytime. No strings.
        </p>
        <div class="tier-actions">
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/dRm4gta6fdPJ5bL8WX3wQ0c" class="pay-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Plant $1,000 →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tier 3: The Constellation -->
      <div class="tier-card">
        <div class="tier-header">
          <div class="tier-symbol">💫</div>
          <div class="tier-title-block">
            <h2 class="tier-name">The Constellation</h2>
            <p class="tier-tagline">A pattern emerges.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-price">$5,000</div>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">
          This is where institutional transformation begins: not through policies developed behind closed doors, but in communities of praxis (theory in action).
        </p>
        <div class="tier-actions">
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/28EeV75PZ3b57jT6OP3wQ0d" class="pay-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Plant $5,000 →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Tier 4: The Universe -->
      <div class="tier-card">
        <div class="tier-header">
          <div class="tier-symbol">🪐</div>
          <div class="tier-title-block">
            <h2 class="tier-name">The Universe</h2>
            <p class="tier-tagline">Water. Earthseed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tier-price">$10,000</div>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">
          You fund an entire crew from the ground up and get to see the world weaving in action. This tier comes with real-time, collaborative documentation of the work as it unfolds: participant voices, transformation in action, and the most wholesome social media feed that will nourish your hope for tomorrow.
        </p>
        <ul class="tier-perks">
          <li>Named crew sponsorship</li>
          <li>Collaborative real-time updates from participants + Quest Labs team</li>
          <li>Positive social documentation, living proof something extraordinary is happening</li>
          <li>Direct line to the Quest Labs founders throughout the crew</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="tier-actions">
          <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/5kQ8wJbajdPJ0Vv7ST3wQ0e" class="pay-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Plant $10,000 →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>




      <details class="ql-fold seed-qr-fold">
        <summary><span class="ql-fold__title">Give from your phone</span></summary>
        <p class="seed-qr-note">or scan to contribute</p>
        <div class="seed-qr-grid">
          <div class="qr-wrap seed-qr">
            <img src="/images/seed/qr-wish.svg" alt="QR code to make a wish, Quest Labs" class="qr-code" />
            <p class="qr-label seed-qr__name">The Wish</p>
          </div>
          <div class="qr-wrap seed-qr">
            <img src="/images/seed/qr-plant-500.svg" alt="QR code to Plant $500, Quest Labs" class="qr-code" />
            <p class="qr-label seed-qr__name">The Spark</p>
          </div>
          <div class="qr-wrap seed-qr">
            <img src="/images/seed/qr-plant-1000.svg" alt="QR code to Plant $1,000, Quest Labs" class="qr-code" />
            <p class="qr-label seed-qr__name">The Pair</p>
          </div>
          <div class="qr-wrap seed-qr">
            <img src="/images/seed/qr-plant-5000.svg" alt="QR code to Plant $5,000, Quest Labs" class="qr-code" />
            <p class="qr-label seed-qr__name">The Constellation</p>
          </div>
          <div class="qr-wrap seed-qr">
            <img src="/images/seed/qr-plant-10000.svg" alt="QR code to Plant $10,000, Quest Labs" class="qr-code" />
            <p class="qr-label seed-qr__name">The Universe</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </section>

    <hr class="section-rule" />

    <!-- Closing -->
    <section class="bet-closing">
      <p>
        <strong class="closing-contact">For larger partnerships, institutional funding, or conversations about embedding Quest Labs in your world,</strong>
        <a href="/contact">let's talk</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="seed-notyet">
      <p class="seed-notyet__line">Not ready to give?</p>
      <a href="https://lu.ma/questlabs" class="seed-notyet__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Come to a free Sandbox Session →</a>
    </section>

  </main>

<footer>
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="footer-logo">Quest Labs</div>
      <div class="footer-tagline">A Living Lab for Futures Literacies</div>
    </div>
    <ul class="footer-links">
      <li><a href="/seed">Seed our becoming</a></li>
      <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-anchor">
    Not sure where to start?
    <a href="https://lu.ma/questlabs">Find a free Sandbox Session →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-copy">2026 Quest Labs · Makēda · All futures reserved · Berlin &amp; Beyond</div>
</footer>

<script is:inline>
  document.querySelectorAll('.faith-item').forEach(item => {
    item.addEventListener('click', () => {
      item.classList.toggle('active');
    });
  });
</script>

</Layout>

<style is:global>
  /* ── BET PAGE ── */

  .bet-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 2.5rem 6rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Hero */
  .bet-hero {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .bet-hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--gold-pale);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .accent-phrase {
    color: var(--violet-light, #B48FE0);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.4rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .hero-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .hero-brand {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    font-size: 1.25em;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--gold-pale);
  }

  .faith-word {
    color: var(--violet-light, #B48FE0);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  /* FAITH block */
  .faith-reveal {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    border-left: 2px solid rgba(107, 63, 160, 0.4);
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .faith-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    cursor: default;
    outline: none;
  }

  .faith-item-letter {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    width: 4rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: #ffffff;
    opacity: 0.15;
    transition: opacity 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .faith-item-text {
    overflow: hidden;
    max-height: 0;
    opacity: 0;
    padding-left: 0.75rem;
    transition: max-height 0.3s ease, opacity 0.25s ease;
  }

  .faith-item:hover .faith-item-letter,
  .faith-item:focus .faith-item-letter,
  .faith-item.active .faith-item-letter {
    opacity: 1;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .faith-item:hover .faith-item-text,
  .faith-item:focus .faith-item-text,
  .faith-item.active .faith-item-text {
    max-height: 80px;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .faith-item-word {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .faith-item-gloss {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    margin-top: 3px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .faith-hint {
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  /* Mobile: tap to toggle */
  @media (hover: none) {
    .faith-item.active .faith-item-letter { opacity: 1; color: #ffffff; }
    .faith-item.active .faith-item-text { max-height: 80px; opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* Rules */
  .section-rule {
    border: none;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border-dim);
    margin: 4rem 0;
  }

  /* Tiers */
  .tiers-section {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal);
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .tier-card {
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border-dim);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;
  }

  .tier-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(139, 116, 171, 0.4);
    background: rgba(107, 63, 160, 0.04);
  }

  .tier-featured {
    border-color: rgba(107, 63, 160, 0.45);
    background: rgba(107, 63, 160, 0.07);
  }

  .tier-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tier-symbol {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }

  .tier-title-block {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .tier-name {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 3px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .tier-tagline {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .tier-price {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    white-space: nowrap;
    color: var(--violet-light, #B48FE0);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .tier-divider {
    height: 0.5px;
    background: var(--border-dim);
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  .tier-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .tier-perks {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .tier-perks li {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    padding: 0.25rem 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .tier-perks li::before {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--violet-light, #B48FE0);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  /* Actions row */
  .tier-actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .pay-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--violet, #6B3FA0);
    color: var(--text);
    border: none;
    transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .pay-btn:hover {
    background: var(--violet-mid, #8B5CC8);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  /* Tier-specific button accents */
  .tier-card:nth-child(1) .pay-btn { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6B3FA0, #8B5CC8); }
  .tier-card:nth-child(2) .pay-btn { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CC8, #B48FE0); color: #0d0619; }
  .tier-card:nth-child(3) .pay-btn { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #453160, #6B3FA0); }
  .tier-card:nth-child(4) .pay-btn { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A0B2B, #6B3FA0); border: 0.5px solid rgba(180,143,224,0.4); }
  .tier-card:nth-child(1) .pay-btn { background: transparent; border: 0.5px solid rgba(180,143,224,0.5); color: var(--violet-light); }
  .tier-card:nth-child(1) .pay-btn:hover { background: rgba(107,63,160,0.15); }

  /* QR code */
  .qr-wrap {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .qr-code {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    display: block;
    opacity: 0.7;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .qr-label {
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Closing */
  .bet-closing {
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .bet-closing p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .bet-closing a {
    color: var(--violet-light);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(180,143,224,0.4);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .bet-closing a:hover {
    border-color: var(--violet-light);
  }

  .section-label-large {
    font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--gold-pale);
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .closing-contact {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    font-style: normal;
    line-height: 1.4;
    display: block;
  }

  .closing-sub {
    font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--teal) !important;
    opacity: 0.7 !important;
    margin-top: 2rem !important;
    font-style: normal !important;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .bet-page { padding: 3rem 1.25rem 4rem; }
    .tier-card { padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem; }
    .tier-header { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .tier-price { width: 100%; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
    .tier-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
  }
</style>
